      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.24,
      "end_seconds": 103.28,
      "duration_seconds": 18.04,
      "text": "Ice helps a bit it happens all the time there's difficulty combing my hair as well i've also had an ache down the upper arm as for ache down the upper arm moderate really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
