      "start_seconds": 173.36,
      "end_seconds": 180.41,
      "duration_seconds": 7.05,
      "text": "Understood. Okay I can see high cholesterol and and arthritis in your knees in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
